From: Harvi654 <202698022+Harvi654@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] msado15/tests: Test text stream charsets and byte positions.

AI-assisted (Codex), original code; LGPL-2.1-or-later. Not submitted upstream.

Offline Windows 10 reports stable byte positions and serialized bytes
for both UTF-8 spellings and for three single-byte encodings. Verify
those results alongside text reads, UTF-8 file loading, truncation,
and directional CopyTo behavior. Keep existing Unicode tests separate.

diff --git a/dlls/msado15/tests/Makefile.in b/dlls/msado15/tests/Makefile.in
index a6c162d..c9fc275 100644
--- a/dlls/msado15/tests/Makefile.in
+++ b/dlls/msado15/tests/Makefile.in
@@ -4,0 +5 @@ SOURCES = \
+	stream_charset.c \
diff --git a/dlls/msado15/tests/stream_charset.c b/dlls/msado15/tests/stream_charset.c
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..bc1a169
--- /dev/null
+++ b/dlls/msado15/tests/stream_charset.c
@@ -0,0 +1,345 @@
+/*
+ * ADODB.Stream text charset tests
